{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"environment based ai api credentials environment based ai api credentials","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md","fileName":"Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Environment-Based AI API Credentials","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI-Assisted Network Automation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted Network Automation","Network AI API Request Anatomy","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"environment based ai api credentials environment based ai api credentials","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md","fileName":"Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Environment-Based AI API Credentials","heading":"Environment-Based AI API Credentials","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An AI API credential should be loaded from an environment variable or a managed secret rather than embedded in a network script. This keeps the key out of source files, examples, and ordinary version-control history while allowing the same program to run with different credentials in different environments.\n\nEnvironment storage is only one layer of protection. The variable still inherits the exposure and lifetime of its process and shell session, so it should be narrowly scoped, rotated, and excluded from logs. A missing key must cause a clear failure before a [[Network AI API Request Anatomy]] call is attempted.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted Network Automation","Network AI API Request Anatomy","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"environment based ai api credentials environment based ai api credentials","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md","fileName":"Environment-Based AI API Credentials.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Environment-Based AI API Credentials","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted Network Automation","Network AI API Request Anatomy","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}